{"schemaVersion":1,"id":-40107,"sections":[{"id":"script-20107","name":"原始脚本 20107","scripts":[20107],"start":0,"count":11}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20107:20107:0","scriptId":20107,"text":"经过一番激战，终于让埃普西隆撤退了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20107:20107:1","scriptId":20107,"text":"“埃普西隆的战斗方式基本就那样了，因为之前有接触过几次，对付她的办法我都知道。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20107:20107:2","scriptId":20107,"text":"“不错嘛～怪不得蕾贝卡那么看中你。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20107:20107:3","scriptId":20107,"text":"“如果是第一次面对她的话，估计肯定对她的分身能力和防弹能力没有办法吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20107:20107:4","scriptId":20107,"text":"“其实看穿了也很简单，只是在揣测对手能力上面，真是比较费时间。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20107:20107:5","scriptId":20107,"text":"“恩，留下了大量的数据，不错不错～有好多可以分析的材料了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20107:20107:6","scriptId":20107,"text":"“那么我们可以回去了吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20107:20107:7","scriptId":20107,"text":"“还不行呢～还有最后一些不明数据要处理，我马上传送你们过去。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20107:20107:8","scriptId":20107,"text":"“诶？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20107:20107:9","scriptId":20107,"text":"（又要眼冒金星了啊……）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20107:20107:10","scriptId":20107,"text":"一想到这里，突然觉得头晕目眩……看来传送已经启动了……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
